WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Pass through the stone entrance toward the oasis courtyard.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
The courtyard opens around the pool and central tree.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.500
Moving water catches light around the tree island.

00:15.500 --> 00:20.500
Directional sand patterns flow across the courtyard surface.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.500
The pool, tree and stone walls form the final composition.
